OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on West Bank
OL,4,Asettlements prompting furious Israeli
OL,5,Aresponse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK has announced sanctions on
OL,8,Fillegal Israeli settlements in the
OL,9,Foccupied West Bank, accusing Israel's
OL,10,Fgovernment of turning a blind eye to
OL,11,Fthe "ethnic cleansing" of Palestinians
OL,12,Fby settlers.
OL,14,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband said the
OL,15,Fmove marked the "beginning of a new
OL,16,Fapproach" to the Israeli-Palestinian
OL,17,Fconflict, which "not only calls out
OL,18,Finjustice and suffering but acts".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
